WEBVTT

00:02:25.454 --> 00:02:30.079
the way we work has maxed out
our psyches and our planet.

00:02:30.454 --> 00:02:33.788
It's also, of course, left
us unprepared to support

00:02:33.788 --> 00:02:37.996
the most vulnerable in our communities
during the worst of times.

00:02:38.496 --> 00:02:41.246
And many of you have told me
because of the last year,

00:02:41.621 --> 00:02:43.496
your ambitions have changed.

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:46.121
You are defining success differently,

00:02:46.621 --> 00:02:50.538
and you want to align your work with
what you want to see in the world.

00:02:50.913 --> 00:02:52.663
You're ready for a reset.

00:02:53.704 --> 00:02:59.996
All right, Maneesh, I would describe this
moment in my career as stagnant

00:02:59.996 --> 00:03:05.329
and unfulfilling, and I wish I could
find something more contributive.